  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nCurrently the spec populates the `activation` attribute on `pageswap` if the old and new Document in the navigation are same-origin. This came up as a concern during Blink's security review of the feature. In the interest of limiting information exposure to when its strictly necessary, we'd like to only provide this information when the navigation is same-origin *and* there are no cross-origin URLs in the redirect chain.\r\n\r\n@noamr @smaug---- @zcorpan @nt1m ",
